Dialogue: 0,0:01:18.32,0:01:22.93,Owari OP BR,,0,0,0,,{\fad(360,360)\blur1.95}Irei te trazer de volta, pois estou sempre pronta para lutar
Dialogue: 0,0:01:24.58,0:01:28.96,Owari OP BR,,0,0,0,,{\fad(360,360)\blur1.95}Por isso, não se culpe tanto, estávamos todos errados
Dialogue: 0,0:01:28.96,0:01:32.34,Owari OP BR,,0,0,0,,{\fad(360,360)\blur1.95}Portanto, não carregue todo esse peso, como sempre faz
Dialogue: 0,0:01:32.34,0:01:36.34,Owari OP BR,,0,0,0,,{\fad(360,360)\blur1.95}Sempre haverá algo que você não pode controlar
Dialogue: 0,0:01:36.34,0:01:40.72,Owari OP BR,,0,0,0,,{\fad(360,360)\blur1.95}Vamos triunfar, sua salvação começou
Dialogue: 0,0:01:40.97,0:01:46.85,Owari OP BR,,0,0,0,,{\fad(360,360)\blur1.95}Sem sinais, sem luzes, há tanta confusão
Dialogue: 0,0:01:46.85,0:01:48.85,Owari OP BR,,0,0,0,,{\fad(180,360)\blur1.95}Não destrua suas esperanças
Dialogue: 0,0:01:48.85,0:01:54.61,Owari OP BR,,0,0,0,,{\fad(360,360)\blur1.95}Você me faz perceber de quem eu preciso
Dialogue: 0,0:01:54.99,0:01:59.20,Owari OP BR,,0,0,0,,{\fad(0,180)\blur1.95}Estarei lá, aguente firme, eles tentarão te mudar
Dialogue: 0,0:01:59.28,0:02:02.37,Owari OP BR,,0,0,0,,{\fad(180,180)\blur1.95}Onde você está agora?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:02.37,0:02:05.00,Owari OP BR,,0,0,0,,{\fad(180,80)\blur1.95}Te alcançarei ao amanhecer
Dialogue: 0,0:02:05.00,0:02:06.87,Owari OP BR,,0,0,0,,{\fad(80,180)\blur1.95}As sombras aparecem
Dialogue: 0,0:02:06.87,0:02:10.08,Owari OP BR,,0,0,0,,{\fad(180,180)\blur1.95}Ilusões nascem
Dialogue: 0,0:02:10.84,0:02:14.21,Owari OP BR,,0,0,0,,{\fad(180,120)\blur1.95}Os anjos caídos que te acompanham não sabem
Dialogue: 0,0:02:14.21,0:02:18.66,Owari OP BR,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,180)\blur1.95}É a nossa dor que nos torna humanos, afinal
Dialogue: 0,0:02:18.66,0:02:21.64,Owari OP BR,,0,0,0,,{\fad(180,180)\blur1.95}Fotografias em sépia antigas mostram
Dialogue: 0,0:02:21.64,0:02:23.64,Owari OP BR,,0,0,0,,{\fad(180,110)\blur1.95}Nosso frágil mundo precioso
Dialogue: 0,0:02:23.64,0:02:27.48,Owari OP BR,,0,0,0,,{\fad(100,540)\blur1.95}Que descartamos ao responder o chamado
